OL,3,GNEWSATwo vehicles seized after hare
OL,4,Acoursing alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized two vehicles after
OL,7,Fofficers received reports of a
OL,8,Fsuspected hare coursing incident in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FOfficers were called after men and dogs
OL,12,Fwere spotted in a field near Blyth
OL,13,Fshortly after 08:00 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FUpon arrival, police found and seized a
OL,16,FVauxhall stuck in the mud and an
OL,17,Fabandoned Toyota Land Cruiser.
OL,19,FNottinghamshire Police said it believed
OL,20,F"no hares were harmed", and that it had
OL,21,Fbeen "a very expensive and inconvenient
OL,22,Fmorning for the people involved".
